        'It installs on the phone\'s home screen, like any app. It scans with the camera, and if a code cannot be read, you type it. The answer comes at once, with sound and vibration, so the person at the gate doesn\'t have to keep their eyes on the screen.' => '',      // vinde-bilete.php
