        'The live status of Viaqui: the site, the ticketing platform, payments and ticket delivery, with the history of the last 90 days.' => '',      // status.php
        'The main sights, guided tours and what not to miss.' => '',      // city.php
        'The main steps for buying activity tickets through Viaqui.' => '',      // cum-functioneaza.php
        'The map needs JavaScript. The full list is on the <a href="{url}">attractions page</a>, which you can filter by type and by country.' => '',      // includes/v2/map-page.php
        'The map of Europe shows the {count} best-known attractions out of the {catalogue} we list in {countries}: {types} and more. Every pin opens the page of the place.' => '',      // map.php
        'The map of attractions' => '',      // hub-atractii.php
        'The map opens on the <strong>Popular</strong> selection, which leaves out churches, lakes and bridges; there are many of them and they would cover everything else. Turn them on at any time from <strong>Types of places</strong>. For a plain list, see <a href="{listUrl}">the attractions of {country}</a>; for the whole continent, <a href="{mapUrl}">the map of Europe</a>.' => '',      // map.php
        'The map shows everything at once, which is a lot. These are the routes already drawn and the places we would open first.' => '',      // map.php
        'The map shows everything at once. These are the places we would open first.' => '',      // includes/v2/map-page.php
        'The map stays on screen and follows the list: the day you have reached, then the stop and its neighbours, then the town you sleep in. The plan is yours: drag the stops where you want, within the day or to another day, remove what you do not like, add something else. If a stop does not suit you, open it and choose <em>Replace</em>: you get a few places near it, chosen by the same interests, and the one you pick takes its position in the day.' => '',      // plan.php
        'The mobile app: Android & iOS' => '',      // devino-partener.php
        'The model can include a commission per ticket, optional services or promotion packages. The idea is simple: you pay for infrastructure that sells, not for vague promises.' => '',      // pentru-locatii.php
        'The most important things to know before you buy.' => '',      // cum-functioneaza.php
        'The number of people matters when you look for a place to stay, for the nights between the days. On a motorcycle the plan looks for views and allows longer rides between stops; on a bicycle it stays close and measures the road on the cycling network.' => '',      // plan.php
        'The numbers on the map and in the list are the same order; press a stop to see it on the map, or open its page for the description and the address.' => '',      // route.php
        'The on-site sales module is switched on for the venue\'s account.' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The operator panel' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The order and its tickets will appear in <a href="{orders}">My orders</a>.' => '',      // recuperare-comanda.php
        'The order appears in the dashboard, the tickets are issued automatically, the customer receives the confirmation, and you can see the participants and validate the tickets at the entrance.' => '',      // pentru-locatii.php
        'The order has been added to your account' => '',      // recuperare-comanda.php
