        'The payment was cancelled and nothing was charged. You can try again below.' => '',      // checkout.php
        'The payment was confirmed and your tickets have been issued.' => '',      // embed/confirmare.php
        'The payout goes to the venue\'s account' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The places that define the city, and what you can do around them.' => '',      // city.php
        'The planner builds a day-by-day itinerary from the attractions, experiences and venues nearby, in the order they link up on the road. The map and the routes are shortcuts to the same places.' => '',      // includes/v2/header.php
        'The planner does not invent places: it takes the real attractions of the catalogue, filters them by what interests you, groups them into days so that each day stays in one area, and puts them in the order that keeps the driving short. No language model writes these itineraries, which is why it will never tell you something about a place that is not in the catalogue.' => '',      // plan.php
        'The planner does not invent places: it takes the real attractions of the catalogue, filters them by what interests you, groups them into days so that each day stays in one area, and puts them in the order that keeps the driving short. The best-known places come first. No language model writes these itineraries, which is why it will never tell you something about a place that is not in the catalogue.' => '',      // plan.php
        'The platform fees and any processing fees are shown separately to keep things transparent. The final total is shown before you confirm the payment.' => '',      // ajutor.php
        'The platform integrates with all tracking pixels and with Facebook CAPI, sending 100% of conversion events without them being blocked by ad blockers or iOS. The result: the cost of your ads on Facebook, Instagram, TikTok and Google drops by up to 60%.' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The platform is built for different activities, with different access models: time slots, simple tickets, packages, guided tours, day access, groups or private events.' => '',      // pentru-locatii.php
        'The platform suits escape rooms, museums, exhibitions, amusement parks, adventure parks, caves, nature reserves, workshops, guided tours, educational farms and other experiences that sell tickets or bookings.' => '',      // pentru-locatii.php
        'The price filter is in euro: €10 is about {amount}.' => '',      // includes/v2/currency.php
        'The process is the same whether you choose an escape room, a museum, a cave, a nature reserve or a workshop for kids.' => '',      // cum-functioneaza.php
        'The ratings and preferences in your reviews can improve what we recommend next.' => '',      // user/reviews.php
        'The recipient enters the code in the cart or at checkout. If the order value is lower than the available balance, the difference can stay on the card, according to the gift card rules.' => '',      // card-cadou.php
        'The recipient picks the city, the category, the date and the activity that suits them.' => '',      // card-cadou.php
        'The region with the most is {region} ({regionCount}), and the city with the most is {city}, with {cityCount}.' => '',      // map.php
        'The region with the most is {region} ({regionCount}).' => '',      // map.php
        'The register statement shows how much cash you hand over and how much was taken by card, for each operator\'s shift.' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The reviews you write appear here, together with your drafts.' => '',      // user/reviews.php
        'The rooms have slots every hour, and people used to message us on Instagram to book. Now they pick the time themselves, pay and get the ticket. We just welcome them.' => '',      // includes/v2/partner-testimonials.php
        'The route goes into the planner with its stops, split over days: move, remove or add stops, see the times and look for a place to stay. Or <a href="{url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open the whole route in Google Maps</a>.' => '',      // includes/v2/route-page.php
        'The route has <strong>{stops}</strong> in {countries}, across {regions}.' => '',      // route.php
        'The route has <strong>{stops}</strong> in {countries}, in {region}.' => '',      // route.php
        'The route has <strong>{stops}</strong> in {countries}.' => '',      // route.php
        'The route is a suggestion, not a schedule: you can drive it the other way round, split it over more days or take only the stops on your way. Every stop is also on <a href="{url}">the attractions map of {country}</a>, together with everything else there is to see around it.' => '',      // route.php
        'The rules of viaqui.com, in plain words' => '',      // terms.php
        'The rules of viaqui.com: ordering and payment, tickets, cancellation and refunds, gift cards, the points programme, reviews and the conditions for operators.' => '',      // terms.php
        'The rules, before you pay' => '',      // includes/v2/home/sections.php
        'The same castle is a different day with a five-year-old, with old friends, or with one other person.' => '',      // includes/v2/home/sections.php
        'The same tickets, the same reports, whether the person bought from home or at the ticket office.' => '',      // parteneri.php
