        'The screen stays on while you scan, and the app runs on tablets too' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The screens of the platform: panel, POS and the scanning app' => '',      // vinde-bilete.php
        'The simpler the payment, the more you sell. viaqui.com accepts the most used methods: the customer pays in two taps, with no friction.' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The stops, in order' => '',      // includes/v2/route-page.php
        'The stories below are examples written by us, to show what this section looks like. We replace them with real stories as the first venues get here.' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The ticket office and online sales are in the same report. When we close the register we no longer count twice or keep separate spreadsheets for the accountant.' => '',      // includes/v2/partner-testimonials.php
        'The ticket price is set by the venue. Any service fee is shown as a separate line before you confirm the order.' => '',      // includes/v2/home/data.php
        'The ticket was sent by email' => '',      // parteneri.php
        'The ticketing platform for activities: booking with slots and a calendar, advanced analytics, 100% tracking with Facebook CAPI, regular payouts, a mobile app with offline scanning. 2%* commission that doesn\'t touch your price. Built on Tixello.' => '',      // devino-partener.php
