        'Yes. The balance goes down with each use until it runs out or the card expires. You can check the current balance here at any time.' => '',      // voucher.php
        'Yes. The customer picks the day from the calendar, the time slot, the number of participants and the options. You control the capacity of each slot and take detailed bookings.' => '',      // parteneri.php
